# Hold publishes until asked

Do **not** auto-ship after each shared-app change.

## Do not until the user says so

- Version bumps (`package.json`, Android `versionName`/`versionCode`, `APP_RELEASES`)
- `npm run build` / `cap sync` / signed APK / Windows pack for release
- GitHub Release publish / updater yml upload
- `adb install` / relaunch of the phone or desktop **release** app

## Still OK while iterating

- Source edits and local verification (e.g. `npm run dev:desktop`)
- Commits only when the user asks to commit

## When they ask to publish

Then follow the normal all-platforms ship path (bump, Android + Windows, same GitHub Release, leave the installed release app alone after publish).
